# Terraform local files and sensitive state
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraform.lock.hcl.backup

